# Capture two things with Quick Add, then go to the inbox and file one into a project with Move to; the moved task keeps its due date.
file <<END
INBOX: @inbox
Home:
	- Fix the shelf
END
keys q
type Buy milk due tomorrow
keys <Enter>
status Added to INBOX
keys q
type Call the plumber
keys <Enter>
keys gi
see › INBOX
keys gm
see Move to
type home
keys <Enter>
see › Home
quit
saved <<END
INBOX: @inbox
	- Call the plumber
Home:
	- Fix the shelf
	- Buy milk @due({today+1})
END
